  "overview": {
    "description": "Orientation Goal: Convert interest → admission by showing instant benefit for college life. Starting now builds a stronger English foundation during the first year of college (when English weakens most students). The course blends SPEAKING, READING, GRAMMAR, WRITING, VOCABULARY, and PRONUNCIATION with college-focused tasks.",
    "features": [
      "Tense mastery and error correction for board/college grammar.",
      "Sentence transformation (affirmative/interrogative, positive/negative, degree change).",
      "Voice (active/passive) and narration (direct → indirect).",
      "Academic writing: paragraph, short essay, email/letter, summarizing texts.",
      "Speaking labs: introductions, presentations, debates, group discussions.",
      "Viva and presentation skills (PowerPoint + speaking).",
      "Vocabulary growth: word banks, collocations, idioms & phrases.",
      "Pronunciation and confidence building with live feedback."
    ],
    "audienceTitle": "Who is this for?",
    "audienceText": "SSC grads entering HSC who want stronger English for college classes, viva, assignments, and future professional communication."
